WHAT: In the new scope.All branch, liveDigests only marks a digest live when r.Final is true, dropping non-final refs. WHY: Non-final refs belong to builds still uploading (see the comment and unconditional marking in the ByProject branch at lines 45-48), so Sweep with scope.All will list all blobs (blobs.List(ctx, "")) and delete the blobs of in-flight builds; when those builds finalize, their refs point at deleted blobs, causing data loss. HOW: mark every ref digest as live in the All branch too, mirroring the ByProject path:

	for _, r := range refs {
		live[r.Digest] = true
	}
